<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>For You, Always</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>My Dearest Debby</h1>
            <p>Every moment with you is a treasure</p>
        </header>

        <section class="hero">
            <div class="heart">❤️</div>
            <h2>You Are My Favorite Place to Return To</h2>
            <p>Not perfect, just real, and deeply loved</p>
        </section>

        <section class="memories">
            <h2>Moments I’ll Always Keep</h2>
            <div class="memory-grid">
                <div class="memory-card">
                    <div class="front">
                        <img src="placeholder1.jpg" alt="Memory 1">
                    </div>
                    <div class="back">
                        <p>Our first date</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="memory-card">
                    <div class="front">
                        <img src="placeholder2.jpg" alt="Memory 2">
                    </div>
                    <div class="back">
                        <p>The Beauty one</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="memory-card">
                    <div class="front">
                        <img src="placeholder3.jpg" alt="Memory 3">
                    </div>
                    <div class="back">
                        <p>Our M7 Date</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="message">
            <h2>Something I Need You to Know</h2>
            <p>I may not always say things perfectly, but my intentions have always been sincere.
                You bring calm to my chaos, warmth to my quiet days, and meaning to moments I never knew mattered.
                Loving you feels natural like something I was always meant to do.</p>
            <p>I don’t promise perfection. I promise effort, honesty, and choosing you every day.Are u willing to save us together?.</p>
            <button class="love-button" onclick="showLove()">Yes, Always!</button>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p>With all my love, Ojan</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
